issing 2022 AND 2023 (2 extra items on right: 2022, 2023). Let me check Palmeiras 2022 in primary. Possibly team_record for Palmeiras 2022... Let me debug directly.\n\nActually hold on — maybe it's my profile code: `competitions` built from `all_matches = self._team_matches(name)` — primary_by_team. Let me check what Palmeiras's primary matches in Série A 2022 look like.\n\nLet me debug all of these quickly.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05de65f94001UvIrDe0tDY06s6","sessionID":"ses_fa22e85f8ffeHYTJ3TNp22RZ2x","messageID":"msg_05de61529001BNAarRxy95edG0"}}
